"No matching options" = "没有匹配的选项";
"Service path scope" = "点击后向 claude.ai 和 api.anthropic.com 的匿名追踪端点发出请求，不携带账号 Cookie。结果仅代表一次原生 HTTPS 观测，五分钟后失效，不能用于放行。端点缺失或受限时仍属未验证，不能证明已登录浏览器或 API 请求的实际链路。";
"Risk admission" = "风险准入";
"Required provider evidence" = "必要的服务商证据";
"The approved region, residential classification, low score and clear risk flags are required. Missing or expired evidence keeps apps blocked." = "必须符合批准地区、住宅线路、低风险评分及各项风险标记要求。证据缺失或过期时，应用仍被拦截。";
"Guardian and recovery" = "守护与恢复";
"System supervision" = "系统后台守护";
"The system guardian retains approved configuration, repairs damaged rules and starts fresh validation after recovery. Offline restoration remains a separate local action." = "系统守护程序保存批准的配置、修复损坏的规则，并在恢复后重新验证。离线恢复网络需在本机单独操作。";
"Restart never reuses a previous exit observation" = "重启后重新获取出口证据";
"Recovery did not complete. Keep apps closed and open the matching offline recovery package." = "恢复未完成。请保持应用关闭，并打开版本匹配的离线恢复安装包。";
"Use a single Tailscale IPv4 peer address, or leave it empty." = "请填写单个 Tailscale 对端的 IPv4 地址，或留空。";
"Only SSH to this private peer is allowed on its tunnel after protection opens. Tailscale transport must use the approved VPN; local direct paths remain blocked." = "防护放行后，仅允许通过私有隧道向此对端发起 SSH。Tailscale 的外层连接必须经过已批准的 VPN，本地直连路径仍被拦截。";

"VMess AEAD profile" = "VMess AEAD 配置";
"Shadowsocks AEAD profile" = "Shadowsocks AEAD 配置";
"Waiting for a supported, connected Shadowrocket profile. No protection is active yet." = "正在等待受支持且已连接的 Shadowrocket 配置。防护尚未启用。";
"Shadowrocket is checked automatically. Apps are released only after tunnel stability and risk checks pass." = "自动检查 Shadowrocket；隧道稳定且风险检查通过后才放行应用。";
"Enable automatic protection" = "启用自动防护";
"Reading the active Shadowrocket profile…" = "正在读取 Shadowrocket 当前配置…";
"Automatic detection and protection" = "自动检测与防护";
"Startup monitoring enabled" = "已启用登录自动监测";
"Detection, stability checks, risk admission and recovery run automatically." = "检测、稳定性验证、风险准入和恢复均自动运行。";
"Only connection and encryption metadata is read. Shadowrocket performs the actual handshake." = "仅读取连接及加密类型信息；实际握手由 Shadowrocket 完成。";
"Automatic setup" = "自动设置";
"Connect Shadowrocket once. The active profile, endpoint, tunnel and exit are detected without manual fields or a personal API key." = "连接 Shadowrocket 后自动识别当前配置、节点、隧道和出口，无需填写参数或个人 API 密钥。";
"Risk admission requires a residential classification, score at most 10, clear risk flags and the approved region. Unavailable evidence keeps traffic blocked." = "风险准入要求住宅线路、评分不高于 10、所有风险标记为否且地区获批。证据不可用时保持拦截。";
"Advanced preferences" = "高级偏好设置";

"Policy state · Evidence scope" = "策略状态 · 证据范围";
"Detection and protection events appear here automatically." = "检测与防护事件将自动显示在这里。";

"Set Shadowrocket Global Routing to Proxy. Config and Direct modes are not admitted automatically." = "请将 Shadowrocket 的全局路由切换为 Proxy；Config 和 Direct 模式不会自动准入。";

"Use a dedicated node profile with a numeric IPv4 server address. Hostname bootstrap cannot recover with outside DNS blocked." = "请使用服务器地址为 IPv4 数字地址的独享节点配置。外部 DNS 被拦截时，域名节点无法保证自动重连。";

"Allow read access" = "允许读取";
"Allow Claude Guard to read connection metadata from this Shadowrocket folder. Passwords and subscription payloads are not decoded." = "允许 Claude Guard 读取此 Shadowrocket 文件夹中的连接信息；不会解码密码和订阅内容。";

"Allow read access to the Shadowrocket configuration folder, then detect again." = "请允许读取 Shadowrocket 配置文件夹，然后重新检测。";

"The Shadowrocket configuration format could not be validated. Protection setup is blocked." = "无法验证 Shadowrocket 配置格式，防护设置已停止。";

"The selected Shadowrocket profile is ambiguous. Protection setup is blocked." = "无法唯一确定当前 Shadowrocket 配置，防护设置已停止。";

"The selected profile's transport or encryption settings are not supported for automatic protection." = "当前配置的传输或加密设置暂不支持自动防护。";

"The selected profile changed during detection. A fresh check is required." = "检测期间节点配置发生变化，需要重新检查。";

"Connect Shadowrocket before automatic protection can be activated." = "请先连接 Shadowrocket，再启用自动防护。";

"The active VPN route could not be confirmed. Protection setup is blocked." = "无法确认当前 VPN 路由，防护设置已停止。";

"The tunnel exit check did not return valid evidence. Automatic detection will retry." = "隧道出口检查未返回有效证据，自动检测将重试。";

"A unique live connection from the verified Shadowrocket provider could not be confirmed." = "无法从已验证的 Shadowrocket 提供程序确认唯一的活动节点连接。";

"The VPN path changed during detection. A fresh check is required." = "检测期间 VPN 链路发生变化，需要重新检查。";
"The selected node differs from the sealed bootstrap. Restore networking locally before approving a different node." = "当前所选节点与封锁状态下保存的启动节点不同。请先在本机恢复网络，再批准新节点。";

"Automatic setup could not be completed. Check the protection status before continuing." = "自动设置未能完成，请先确认防护状态再继续使用。";

"The risk provider retry window has not elapsed. Apps stay blocked until fresh evidence is available." = "风险服务的重试间隔尚未结束。在取得最新证据前，应用保持拦截。";

"The risk provider address could not be verified through the tunnel. App traffic remains blocked." = "无法通过隧道验证风险服务地址，应用流量保持拦截。";

"The risk provider did not return a verified HTTPS response. App traffic remains blocked." = "风险服务未返回经验证的 HTTPS 响应，应用流量保持拦截。";

"The risk provider evidence could not be validated. App traffic remains blocked." = "无法验证风险服务返回的证据，应用流量保持拦截。";

"Risk check deferred" = "风险检查等待重试";

"Guardian settings changed during this operation. Check the current status and try again." = "操作期间守护设置发生变化，请查看当前状态后重试。";

"Automatic protection is disabled. Enable it to resume detection and enforcement." = "自动防护已关闭。重新启用后才会恢复检测和拦截。";
